--- !u!114 &1719676592
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1719676585}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 1f87a97d93962344ba7d9b47582c7773, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: '::'
  introDialogue:
  - 'King: Humans... Has your kind not done enough damage to my Empire?'
  - '!<NAME>!: We are not here to fight, unless you force us to.'
  - 'King: Why are you invading my land?'
  - '!<NAME>!: Our kingdom has been abducted by an evil man. Somehow he''s obtained
    the power of Devil''s Magic.'
  - 'Ponter: The power that you seem to posess as well.'
  - 'King: I was, once... My power has been greatly limited when your kind imprisoned
    me here.'
  - 'King: I might seem weak... But even my weakened state is more than you two can
    handle.'
  - 'King: My Trident... The last remnant of my power.'
  - 'King: For centuries I''ve been regaining strength to rebuild my city.'
  - 'King: Makes me remember the old days... Vaunquishing my treacherous brothers
    by just pointing my Trident at them.'
  - 'King: Oh, how far I''ve fallen...'
  - '!<NAME>!: Do you still feel hate towards humans?'
  - 'King: With time I''ve come to accept, that my rulership brought my fate upon
    me. I''ve made many enemies.'
  - 'King: And I''ve paid the ultimate price. I''m indifferent to your kind, unless
    you seek to destroy me.'
  - 'King: All I want is to rebuild my Empire and protect it at all cost.'
  - '!<NAME>!: Would it be possible for us to take your Trident? To defeat Lord Magnus?'
  - 'King: Only if you prove your strength. If you fail to obtain it, the everlasting
    darkness in it will consume me, and I will be forced to fight you.'
  - 'King: However you might also sacrifice the place you hold the most dear to your
    heart, and in exchange I will bless you with power to destroy your foe.'
  - 'King: I see great potential in you. You''ve come a long way to get here. I would
    be honored if you chose to become my vessel. We could achieve great things together.'
  dialoguePlayer: {fileID: 1351020331}
  reqStr: 35
  floodCutscene: {fileID: 0}
  posessedCutscene: {fileID: 0}
  ponter: {fileID: 569031163}
  strSucess:
  - '!<NAME>!: I... I did it.'
  - 'Ponter: We finally have a chance to destroy Magnus!'
  - 'King: It appears my Trident has accepted you as it''s wielder.'
  - 'King: You have proved your strength, and I have to accept it.'
  - 'King: I wish you good luck on your mission.'
  - 'King: Perhaps we''ll get to see each other again one day.'
  - '!<NAME>!: If I succeed, I promise to help you rebuild your town.'
  - '!<NAME>!: However if I find out that your real goal is harmful to my kind...
    We will come back in full force.'
  - 'King: I understand, human. You can leave this place now.'
  strFail:
  - '!<NAME>!: Oh no. I failed...'
  - 'King: Arghh!!! You fool!'
  - 'King: You are not worthy of my Trident!'
  - 'King: Get ready to die, you filth!'
  floodDialogue: []
  trident: {fileID: 1732391544}
  tridentFire: {fileID: 708319433}
  tridentColor: {r: 0.9490196, g: 0.08235294, b: 1, a: 1}
